### 1. Testar CPF com tamanho incorreto (Deve retornar erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste Tamanho CPF",
    "email": "erro@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345",
    "endereco": "Rua Teste, 0",
    "celular": "48900000000"
}

### 2. Cadastrar Cliente 1 - Marcos (Público)
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "Rua das Flores, 123",
