### 14. Cadastrar Agendamento 1 (25/10/2026 - Marcos)
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "tipoServico": "revisão",
    "idVeiculo": 1,
    "idCliente": 1
}

