### 17. Atualizar Agendamento 1 (Altera data para 30/10/2026)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

### 19. Atualizar Agendamento Inexistente (Deve retornar erro 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

### 20. Listar Agenda Ordenada por Data (Ordem: 05/10, 15/10 e 30/10)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 21. Testar Rota Protegida Sem Token (Deve retornar erro 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos

### 22. Deletar Cliente Inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/999
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 23. Deletar Cliente 3 (Roberto)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
